    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "BLACK OUT NIGHT (BON): Copperbelt\n\nBlack Out Night (BON) returns, centred around the world premiere of the English Theatre production of Natasha Mumba’s Copperbelt, delivering a full end-to-end experience rooted in the spirit of Ubuntu, “I am because we are.”\n\nThe evening opens with a vibrant Market and Community Hub showcasing local women-led businesses and artists from Ottawa’s African and Caribbean diasporas — a space to gather, celebrate, and support community.\n\nAfter the performance of Copperbelt, the energy keeps going with BON Nuit, a..."
      }
